ror_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-5163510","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:08:20Z","value":4,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5310490","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5163510-1847286114041768","game_id":"steam-5163510","kind":"announcement","title":"Out Tuesday with 15% off in launch week!","summary":"Bugs & Birdies comes out this Tuesday, October 27! For the first week it's 15% off: €6.79 / $6.79 instead of €7.99 / $7.99. Prices in all other currencies drop by the same 15%. Build, farm, fish and craft on your own little island Play solo or in online co-op with up to 4 players Every morning the Wheel of Fate spins, and every night the beetles come Head down into the dungeons and take on the big bosses below Now in 10 languages More than 550 of you have already put Bugs & Birdies on your wishl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:51:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041768","verified_at":"2026-10-25T12:15:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163510-1847286114037107","game_id":"steam-5163510","kind":"announcement","title":"Show us your base and win your own item in the game!","summary":"Steam Next Fest is in full swing, and you have built amazing things in the demo. Now we want to see them! How to enter Record a short clip of your base in Bugs & Birdies (demo or full game) Post it in the #bugs-and-birdies channel on our Discord, together with your idea for a new item in the game Deadline: October 26, 7 pm CET (11 am PDT) Tip: Steam's built-in game recording is all you need to capture your clip. What you can win We pick the best entries and put them to a vote on Instagram (@bugs","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:22:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037107","verified_at":"2026-10-23T21:47:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163510-1847286114030518","game_id":"steam-5163510","kind":"announcement","title":"Bugs & Birdies now speaks 10 languages!","summary":"Players from all over the world have put Bugs & Birdies on their wishlist, and many of you asked to play in your own language. From today the game speaks ten languages: English and German, and now also Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Russian, Japanese, Korean, French, Spanish and Turkish. Everything is translated: menus, items, recipes, the Compendium, tasks, the Journal and How to play The game starts in your Steam language automatically You can switch at any time under Options › Langu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:37:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030518","verified_at":"2026-10-22T02:41:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163510-1846651706694872","game_id":"steam-5163510","kind":"announcement","title":"Pumpkin Night is now in the free demo!","summary":"Our Halloween event has arrived in the free demo, just in time for Steam Next Fest. Pumpkin Night At night, pumpkin beetles hide between the pumpkins and jump out when you get close Ghost beetles drift over the graveyard and fade away at sunrise Place a cursed pumpkin and the Pumpkin King rises in the night Trade candy with the frogs, brew potions in the witch's cauldron and fly through the night on a witch's broom Decorate your farm with jack-o'-lanterns, gravestones, spider webs and a spooky s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:34:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694872","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163510-1846651706692499","game_id":"steam-5163510","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is live!","summary":"Steam Next Fest has started, and Bugs & Birdies is part of it! From October 19 to 26 you can play our free demo, and it is not a small slice: the whole island world is open. Build a home together, farm your fields and keep your chickens happy Fish from the dock by day and by night, and keep a fish book of every catch Spin the Wheel of Fate every morning: a storm, an earthquake or a giant worm might be waiting Dive into dungeons, beat bosses like the Fiddle Beetle and find legendary gear Fly acro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:48:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163510-1846651706684012","game_id":"steam-5163510","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo is out now!","summary":"The Bugs & Birdies demo is live on Steam, just in time for Steam Next Fest (October 19 to 26). And it is not a small slice: the whole island world is open, nothing is locked. Build a home, farm your fields and keep your chickens happy Fish from the dock by day and by night, and maybe meet the octopus Spin the Wheel of Fate and see what the day brings: a storm, an earthquake or a giant worm Dive into dungeons, fight bosses and find legendary gear Play online co-op with up to four friends New sinc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T07:35:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684012","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163510-1845383656385108","game_id":"steam-5163510","kind":"announcement","title":"Music Plates & the Fiddle Beetle","summary":"Bugs & Birdies has a new way to play: music. Four new floor plates sound like a piano, a trumpet, a choir and a double bass whenever someone steps on them. Tap a plate to tune it a semitone higher, lay a few side by side and walk your melody across the farm. Everyone plays along: friends, chickens, frogs and even beetles make a sound when they cross a plate In co-op, four players can walk four voices at once and play a whole song together The plates are crafted from planks, string, cloth and cop","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T06:24:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385108","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163510-1844751498217761","game_id":"steam-5163510","kind":"announcement","title":"Four players, one farmstead: co-op is in","summary":"Bugs & Birdies now has online co-op for up to four players. Open your world to friends through Steam, build together, split up to mine and fish, and hold the beetles off side by side when the swarms come at night. Friends who return later pick up right where they left off, backpack and all. And that is only part of it. The game has grown a lot since the page went live, in one big update full of new content: Fishing has been expanded massively: shadows under the water, a line you have to keep tig","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T08:34:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217761","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5163510":{"last